        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/Doom-on-Evercade.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>The <a href=\"https://evercade.co.uk/\">Evercade</a> consoles remain one of the most fascinating pieces of modern hardware on the market. Mainly aimed at collectors, but also welcoming enough so that younger gamers become interested in retro gaming, they blur the line between modern emulation and older original consoles. Now, the king of retro shooters is coming to them: <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/doom\">Doom</a> is invading yet another platform.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/doom-coming-to-evercade-consoles\">Read more</a></p>",
