        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/helldivers-2-tank.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>A new stage in the <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/helldivers-2\">Helldivers 2</a> galactic war for democracy has begun in earnest, spurred on by the Automatons stealing blueprints for Super Earth's Star of Peace space station. In response to this rebellious action, players will have to travel back to their home planet first introduced in the original <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/helldivers\">Helldivers</a>: Cyberstan.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/helldivers-2-armours-up-for-its-very-own-star-war-as-automatons-have-stolen-plans-for-a-planet-killing-space-station\">Read more</a></p>",
